## 4. Season
- Fresh Alphonso season: February to June, peak March to May.
- The 2027 season starts on 1 February 2027.
- Outside the season fresh fruit is sold out. Pulp, dry fruits and saffron are available all year.

## 5. Delivery and logistics
- Delivery is free across India.
- Couriers: Blue Dart, Delhivery and Ekart.
- In season, orders placed before 12 noon IST are dispatched the same day, Monday to Saturday.
- Metro cities typically take 1 to 3 days. Enter the pincode on the product page to check delivery.
- Delivery cities include Mumbai, Delhi NCR (Gurgaon, Noida), Bangalore, Hyderabad, Chennai, Kolkata, Pune, Jaipur and Ahmedabad.
- Transit damage or a quality problem: report within 24 hours of delivery with photos or video on WhatsApp +91 70830 75556. We replace the fruit with a fresh dispatch or credit your account.
- Policies: https://alphonsomango.in/pages/shipping-policy and https://alphonsomango.in/pages/return-policy

